{"title":"2011 CSMC Problems/Part A Problem 1","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_CSMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Determine the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/e/7/2e79a5e5bd8c4b4c599dd5bfd3fd0a35b0b8d171.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^{4}(1 + \\frac{1}{2} + \\frac{1}{2^{2}} + \\frac{1}{2^{3}} + \\frac{1}{2^{4}})$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"205\" height=\"38\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_CSMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/2/2/b22a336a48eed2aff1660d8eef353b37ae69fc8d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^{4}(1 + \\frac{1}{2} + \\frac{1}{2^{2}} + \\frac{1}{2^{3}} + \\frac{1}{2^{4}}) = 2^{4} + 2^{3} + 2^{2} + 2^{1} + 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"394\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/e/41eca4038aff230d6a1462dbfef15867582c90ab.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=16 + 8 + 4 + 2 + 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"164\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/8/b/48b0b1f1de1b00167d54a5ea9e5852b514ee68f6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=24 + 6 + 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"102\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/7/2/2727b680055269b1944f1d8b5a493cc57f7e3fdc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=\\boxed{31}$\" style=\"vertical-alig